# docs/evidence: default NO (AGENTS.md 第六节 提交纪律); only whitelisted dirs may be
# committed on purpose, heavy rebuild products stay excluded everywhere.
# To admit a new evidence dir: add `!docs/evidence/<sub>/` after the `aholo/*`
# re-ignore line, and re-ignore any heavy payloads it contains.
docs/evidence/*
!docs/evidence/B1/
!docs/evidence/SC-16/
!docs/evidence/C1/
!docs/evidence/mp-del/
!docs/evidence/aholo/
docs/evidence/aholo/*
# #79 验收走查证据（清单 §5 指定 docs/evidence/79/<case>/，按上面写的流程开白名单）
!docs/evidence/79/
# 户外漫游 W1/W2/W3 真机走查证据（2026-11-18，Chromium + swiftshader 本机跑）
!docs/evidence/walk-2026-11-18/
!docs/evidence/walk-2026-11-18-round2/
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig/
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig-local/
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig-tpose/
!docs/evidence/aholo/recheck-tearoom-3FO4K4RL8KM8/
!docs/evidence/aholo/xh02-0233-low/
!docs/evidence/aholo/xh02-0233-normal/
!docs/evidence/aholo/people02-hanfu/
# 该目录只放行小体积证据（png/json）；glb/zip 等大文件只留本地，不入仓（2026-11-21）
# 只放行小体积证据（png/json）；其余（glb/zip/jpg 等）一律不入仓，本地保留（2026-11-21）
docs/evidence/aholo/people02-hanfu/**/*.*
!docs/evidence/aholo/people02-hanfu/**/*.png
!docs/evidence/aholo/people02-hanfu/**/*.json
docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig-tpose/*.png
docs/evidence/aholo/recheck-tearoom-3FO4K4RL8KM8/web-upload-images/
# Heavy rebuild products / bulk captures: never commit from any evidence dir
docs/evidence/**/*.spz
docs/evidence/**/*.ply
docs/evidence/**/*.zip
docs/evidence/**/*.mp4
docs/evidence/**/*.lrf
docs/evidence/**/*_hq.glb

